        "original_id": "1f1373a1-b55b-5940-83ff-454e0b66dfe3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Reitinger, Wim Wenders, Bruno Ganz, Solveig Dommartin\n- Works: Wings of Desire, Faraway, So Close!\n- Topics: film sequels, romantic fantasy films\n\nFacts:\n- Wings of Desire is a 1987 romantic fantasy film directed by Wim Wenders.\n- In Wings of Desire, an angel played by Bruno Ganz falls in love with a lonely trapeze artist played by Solveig Dommartin.\n- Richard Reitinger later reunited with Wim Wenders to write Faraway, So Close!, the sequel to Wings of Desire.",
